        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>机械运动</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {\n        inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n        displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n      }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #ececec;\n      color: #111;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 794px;\n      min-height: 1123px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 31px 118px 70px;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n\n    .brand-row {\n      height: 52px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: flex-end;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #222;\n    }\n\n    .brand {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      margin-right: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .brand-mark {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 36px;\n      height: 34px;\n      margin-right: 7px;\n      border: 1px solid #078eb8;\n      border-radius: 48% 48% 44% 44%;\n      background: #19bde9;\n    }\n\n    .brand-mark::before,\n    .brand-mark::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 13px;\n      width: 4px;\n      height: 5px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #111;\n    }\n\n    .brand-mark::before {\n      left: 9px;\n    }\n\n    .brand-mark::after {\n      right: 9px;\n    }\n\n    .brand-smile {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 12px;\n      bottom: 7px;\n      width: 11px;\n      height: 5px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #111;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n    }\n\n    .brand-name {\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 21px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 23px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .brand-subtitle {\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 5px;\n      letter-spacing: 3px;\n      text-align: center;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      margin: 27px 0 62px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .section {\n      margin-bottom: 43px;\n    }\n\n    .section-heading {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: baseline;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 1;\n    }\n\n    .section-title {\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .section-meta {\n      font-size: 10px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .stars {\n      margin-left: 8px;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n\n    table {\n      width: 100%;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      table-layout: fixed;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      line-height: 1.85;\n    }\n\n    td {\n      border: 1px solid #222;\n      padding: 5px 7px;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n      overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n    }\n\n    .center {\n      padding-left: 4px;\n      padding-right: 4px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .compact {\n      line-height: 1.75;\n    }\n\n    .methods td {\n      padding-top: 3px;\n      padding-bottom: 3px;\n    }\n\n    .examples {\n      font-size: 10px;\n      line-height: 1.9;\n    }\n\n    .page-number {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 119px;\n      bottom: 45px;\n      font-size: 9px;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 794px) {\n      body {\n        background: #fff;\n      }\n\n      .page {\n        width: 100%;\n        min-height: 100vh;\n        padding-left: 14.8vw;\n        padding-right: 14.8vw;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <header class=\"brand-row\">\n      <div class=\"brand\">\n        <div class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <span class=\"brand-smile\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"brand-name\">洋葱学院</div>\n          <div class=\"brand-subtitle\">[illegible]</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <h1>1&nbsp;&nbsp;机械运动</h1>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading\">\n        <div class=\"section-title\">【考点1】长度、时间及其测量</div>\n        <div class=\"section-meta\">难度<span class=\"stars\">★</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;考频&nbsp;☆☆☆</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <table aria-label=\"长度、时间及其测量\">\n        <colgroup>\n          <col style=\"width: 14%;\">\n          <col style=\"width: 35%;\">\n          <col style=\"width: 51%;\">\n        </colgroup>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"center\">单位换算<br>和估测</td>\n            <td class=\"compact\">\n              1km=10<sup>3</sup>m　 1dm=10<sup>-1</sup>m；<br>\n              1cm=10<sup>-2</sup>m； 1mm=10<sup>-3</sup>m；<br>\n              1μm=10<sup>-6</sup>m； 1nm=10<sup>-9</sup>m\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"compact\">\n              一支新的2B铅笔的长度约为18cm；<br>\n              随着音乐做一套眼保健操用时约为4min；<br>\n              物理书的长度是252mm；<br>\n              爸爸的身高是16.7dm；<br>\n              人的心脏正常跳动一次的时间约为0.8s。\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"center\">刻度尺的<br>读数</td>\n            <td>\n              测量结果由数字和单位组成，其中数字部分由准确值加上一位估计值组成\n            </td>\n            <td>\n              若刻度尺的分度值是1mm，那读数应为4.30cm或4.31cm，最后一位“0”、“1”是估读值。\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"methods\">\n            <td class=\"center\" rowspan=\"4\">长度测量<br>的特殊方<br>法</td>\n            <td>累积法</td>\n            <td>测一张纸条的厚度时，可先测50张的厚度。</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"methods\">\n            <td>化曲为直法</td>\n            <td>用棉线测弯曲工件的长度。</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"methods\">\n            <td>平移法（配合法）</td>\n            <td>\n              用两把卡尺测量球体直径；<br>\n              测量圆筒的外长。\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"methods\">\n            <td>比例法</td>\n            <td>利用科学知识等比例测量建筑物高度。</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading\">\n        <div class=\"section-title\">【考点2】机械运动</div>\n        <div class=\"section-meta\">难度<span class=\"stars\">★★</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;考频&nbsp;☆☆☆</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <table aria-label=\"机械运动\">\n        <colgroup>\n          <col style=\"width: 16%;\">\n          <col style=\"width: 34%;\">\n          <col style=\"width: 50%;\">\n        </colgroup>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"center\">参照物</td>\n            <td>\n              要描述一个物体是运动的还是静止的，要先选定一个标准物体作参照，这个选定的标准物体叫参照物\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"examples\">\n              “两岸青山相对出”“孤帆日边来”：<br>\n              人站在下雨水池楼梯的栏上头晕，是因为人选择水为参照物；<br>\n              月亮在云层中穿行是云层为参照物；<br>\n              通常我们说“风力4级”是以地面为参照物。\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"center\">运动和静止<br>的相对性</td>\n            <td>\n              物体是静止的还是运动的，与所选的参照物有关\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"examples\">\n              地球同步卫星运动方向参照物时是静止的，选择太阳为参照物时是运动的；<br>\n              起飞的飞机中的乘客相对大地是运动的，相对飞机是静止的。\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"page-number\">1</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
